[00:00.000] 作词 : momocashew
[00:01.000] 作曲 : momocashew/Yamato Kasai
[00:06.980]
[00:14.360]Side by side, the lovelier goes up
[00:14.360]并肩而立，更可爱的那个向上升起
[00:21.180]Reach for the top, till the bubble pops
[00:21.180]向顶端伸手，直到气泡破裂
[00:28.050]Take a memory, insert to the past
[00:28.050]取一段记忆，嵌进过去
[00:35.050]Which one is the sweetest? Save it before the last
[00:35.050]哪段最甜蜜？赶在结束前把它保存
[00:39.860]
[00:40.900]If you turn into a table
[00:40.900]如果你变成一张桌子
[00:44.140]You must be at the height of my elbows
[00:44.140]一定刚好与我的手肘齐高
[00:47.710]Odd stubby leg makes you wobbly
[00:47.710]古怪的短桌腿让你摇摇晃晃
[00:51.000]You're the only perfect table for me
[00:51.000]你就是我唯一完美的桌子
[00:54.460]If you turn into an eggplant
[00:54.460]如果你变成一根茄子
[00:57.830]You'll be my purple friend
[00:57.830]你会是我的紫色朋友
[01:01.220]Scratchy nail marks on your body
[01:01.220]身上留着指甲划过的痕迹
[01:04.660]You're the only perfect eggplant for me
[01:04.660]你就是我唯一完美的茄子
[01:08.170]I'm searching
[01:08.170]我在寻找
[01:10.910]
[01:22.890]If you're a cat
[01:22.890]如果你是一只猫
[01:25.490]A little kitten
[01:25.490]一只小小的猫咪
[01:27.460]You must be bluepoint
[01:27.460]你一定是蓝重点色
[01:29.760]Meowing a lot
[01:29.760]总是喵喵叫
[01:32.580]Hissing a lot
[01:32.580]总是嘶嘶叫
[01:34.390]But you never purr
[01:34.390]却从不发出呼噜声
[01:36.640]If you're a steak
[01:36.640]如果你是一块牛排
[01:39.500]A fillet mignon covered in mushroom sauce
[01:39.500]一块浇着蘑菇酱的菲力牛排
[01:43.750]Browned on the outside
[01:43.750]外层煎得焦香
[01:46.660]Medium rare inside
[01:46.660]内里恰好三分熟
[01:49.410]
[01:49.720]If you turn into a flower
[01:49.720]如果你变成一朵花
[01:53.150]You must be the most delicate ever
[01:53.150]一定是最娇嫩的那一朵
[01:56.600]Even if you bloom just occasionally
[01:56.600]即使你只是偶尔绽放
[01:59.960]You're the only perfect flower for me
[01:59.960]你就是我唯一完美的花
[02:03.440]If you turn into a human
[02:03.440]如果你变成一个人
[02:06.820]I'd like all the warmth coming from your hands
[02:06.820]我想感受你双手传来的所有温暖
[02:10.240]Bit of stinky breath, with hair that's unruly
[02:10.240]口气有点臭，头发也乱糟糟
[02:13.650]You're the only perfect human for me
[02:13.650]你就是我唯一完美的人
[02:17.090]I'm searching
[02:17.090]我在寻找
[02:21.570]
[02:31.840]If you're a piece
[02:31.840]如果你是一块
[02:34.790]A piece of ****
[02:34.790]一块 ****
[02:36.420]You must be… U-Um?
[02:36.420]那你一定是……呃，嗯？
[02:38.850]What? What's it called?
[02:38.850]什么？那叫什么来着？
[02:41.640]What's that word again
[02:41.640]那个词到底是什么来着
[02:43.660]"Do-o-o-o-ope"?
[02:43.660]“令我沉醉”？
[02:45.730]If you could stay
[02:45.730]如果你能留下
[02:48.600]Stay there where you are
[02:48.600]留在你现在的地方
[02:50.430]So again… U-Um?
[02:50.430]所以，再来一次……呃，嗯？
[02:52.280]Oh, what? What's it called?
[02:52.280]哦，什么？那叫什么来着？
[02:55.430]What's that word again?
[02:55.430]那个词到底是什么来着？
[02:57.350]"Lo-o-o-ove"?
[02:57.350]“爱——”？
[02:59.410]
[02:59.470]I'm searching for
[02:59.470]我在寻找
[03:00.970]Searching for you everywhere
[03:00.970]在每个角落寻找你
[03:02.650]I can see you in most everything
[03:02.650]几乎在万物之中都能看见你
[03:06.430]I'm searching for
[03:06.430]我在寻找
[03:07.760]Searching for you everywhere
[03:07.760]在每个角落寻找你
[03:09.370]But somehow you can stop transforming
[03:09.370]可不知怎么，你却能停止变幻
[03:13.280]I'm searching for, searching for, searching for
[03:13.280]我在寻找，寻找，寻找
[03:16.320]Searching for, searching for, searching for
[03:16.320]寻找，寻找，寻找
[03:18.930]A-Ah
[03:18.930]啊——啊
[03:20.250]I'm searching for, searching for, searching for
[03:20.250]我在寻找，寻找，寻找
[03:23.160]My old self that's gone since you have left
[03:23.160]寻找自你离去便消失的从前的我
[03:26.950]
[03:27.140]Each one of us has a bucket of love
[03:27.140]我们每个人都有一桶爱
[03:34.350]Some of us empty, some of us filled up
[03:34.350]有些人的空了，有些人的满了
[03:41.180]Cut us into pieces, break us down to the cell
[03:41.180]将我们切成碎片，分解到细胞
[03:48.160]Merge us back up, we have evolved now
[03:48.160]再把我们拼合，我们如今已进化
[03:52.860]
